estfile\nben@tree:~/Development/testannex$ touch testfile2\nben@tree:~/Development/testannex$ git annex proxy -- git add testfile2\nfatal: pathspec 'testfile2' did not match any files\nben@tree:~/Development/testannex$ git annex proxy -- git status\nOn branch annex/direct/master\nnothing to commit, working directory clean\n```\n\nAdditionally, when using absolute path the result surprisingly states, this was outside repository:\n\n```\nben@tree:~/Development/testannex$ git annex proxy -- git add /home/ben/Development/testannex/testfile2\nfatal: /home/ben/Development/testannex/testfile2: '/home/ben/Development/testannex/testfile2' is outside repository\n```\n\nSo far, I don't see what's wrong here.","files":null}]}